@host = http://localhost:5080/fhir
@nin = 18727094136
@plan = 8526cf24-a37a-4b3f-b59c-a4479b75f901

### Capability statement
GET {{host}}/metadata

### Search CarePlans (+ Patient, + ServiceRequests per zone)
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&_include=CarePlan:subject&_revinclude=ServiceRequest:based-on

### Only active plans (maps to upstream is_active=true)
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&status=active

### Using the identifier form
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient:identifier=urn:oid:2.16.578.1.12.4.1.4.1|{{nin}}

### Plans changed since (maps to upstream updated_since)
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&_lastUpdated=ge2026-09-01T00:00:00Z

### Only published plans
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&published=true

### Search Compositions (plan documents with one section per zone)
GET {{host}}/Composition?patient={{nin}}

### Search ServiceRequests (one per zone; priority routine/urgent/asap)
GET {{host}}/ServiceRequest?patient={{nin}}

### Search Tasks (approvals + publications)
GET {{host}}/Task?patient={{nin}}

### Search Provenance (who changed the plan)
GET {{host}}/Provenance?patient={{nin}}

### CarePlan with its approval/publication Tasks and Composition
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&_revinclude=Task:focus&_revinclude=Composition:entry&_revinclude=Provenance:target

### Read
GET {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}

### Audit events for a plan (upstream /history) and version read
GET {{host}}/Provenance?target=CarePlan/{{plan}}

###
GET {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}/_history/1

### Paging
GET {{host}}/CarePlan?patient={{nin}}&_count=20&_offset=20

### FHIR document Bundle
GET {{host}}/Composition/{{plan}}/$document

### Everything derived from the plan
GET {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}/$everything

### Derived resource reads
GET {{host}}/ServiceRequest/{{plan}}-zone-3

###
GET {{host}}/Task/{{plan}}-approval-2

###
GET {{host}}/Provenance/{{plan}}-rev-2

### PlanDefinition (static definition of the plan structure; CarePlan.instantiatesCanonical points here)
GET {{host}}/PlanDefinition

###
GET {{host}}/PlanDefinition/personal-plan

### Operations on a CarePlan (state changes). revision and version are required by the upstream (defaults to the current values when omitted).
POST {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}/$activate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Parameters",
  "parameter": [
    { "name": "comment", "valueString": "Aktiverer planen" },
    { "name": "revision", "valueInteger": 3 },
    { "name": "version", "valueInteger": 1 }
  ]
}

###
POST {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}/$approve
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{ "resourceType": "Parameters", "parameter": [ { "name": "comment", "valueString": "Godkjent" }, { "name": "revision", "valueInteger": 3 }, { "name": "version", "valueInteger": 1 } ] }

###
POST {{host}}/CarePlan/{{plan}}/$publish
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{ "resourceType": "Parameters", "parameter": [ { "name": "comment", "valueString": "Publisert til kjernejournal" }, { "name": "revision", "valueInteger": 3 }, { "name": "version", "valueInteger": 1 } ] }
